---
import {
  ShieldCheck,
  Mail,
  Phone,
  Instagram,
  Heart,
  MapPin,
} from "lucide-astro";
---

<footer class="bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 text-slate-600 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-12">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-slate-200"
    >
      <!-- Brand & Mission column -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"
          >
            <ShieldCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-white" />
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-xl font-bold font-display tracking-tight text-slate-950"
          >
            Vochranka<span class="text-blue-600">.</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Diskrétní bezpečnostní technologie navržená s empatií pro sólo
          masérky, kosmetičky a terapeutky. Klid při každém klientském setkání.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com/vochranka.cz"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-800 hover:text-blue-600 hover:border-blue-300 transition-colors shadow-xs"
          >
            <Instagram class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600" />
            <span>@vochranka.cz</span>
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Sledujte nás na Instagramu</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal & Contact -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-3 md:pl-12">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-950">
          Kontakt & Provozovatel
        </h4>

        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Phone class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 shrink-0" />
            <a
              href="tel:+420777123456"
              class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">+420 777 123 456</a
            >
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">(Po–Pá 9:00–18:00)</span>
          </p>

          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Mail class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 shrink-0" />
            <a
              href="mailto:info@vochranka.cz"
              class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">info@vochranka.cz</a
            >
          </p>

          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <MapPin class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 shrink-0" />
            <span>Praha, Česká republika (osobní zkoušky v salónech)</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
        >
          <p><strong>Provozovatel:</strong> Vochranka • <strong>IČO:</strong> 19842531</p>
          <p>Zapsáno u Městského soudu v Praze.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom copyright -->
    <div
      class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500"
    >
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Vochranka. Všechna práva vyhrazena.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors"
          >Ochrana osobních údajů (GDPR)</a
        >
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors"
          >Obchodní podmínky</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
